window.products.push({"id":1092187,"name":"KITVINOUS Wine Opener, Professional Waiters Corkscrew with Foil Cutter & Dual Hinge, Stainless Steel Wine Key for Servers and Bartenders (Blackwood)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zMIHTGQkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Only for Professionals - Curated by Kitvinous with the sommelier in mind, made of premium stainless-steel with elegant wooden grip, makes it ideal for any hectic work environment that requires extensive use of the wine bottle opener and it can handle any kind of cork or metal cap effortlessly. the construction also makes the corkscrew sturdy, durable and offers excellent balance Why Detail Matter -Thanks to the non-stick glided and even worm, with a inline groove that improves the grip and minimizes the crumbling of the cork. the unique design guarantees that the wine key can remove any cork, natural or synthetic, in just 5 turns or less. the waiters corkscrew can also screw into dry cork very easily Uncork Effortless - A double-hinge style waiter corkscrew wine opener, which features one hinge near the middle of the tool that is utilized first. and the second hinge at the end provides leverage for getting the cork all the way out. this design allows for the easy extraction of corks, without breakage, with a minimal amount of energy expenditure All-in-1 Waiters Corkscrew - Equipped with a serrated knife of heavy-duty stainless steel which is an excellent waiter corkscrew that can smoothly remove foils that easier as well as reduces the risk of gliding and minimizes any foil or plastic shredding. in addition to removing the foil and cork, you can also use this tool to open the beer bottle effortlessly Serving Wine A Breeze - The wine key for servers is an excellent tool that lets you handle your duties as a waiter or professional sommelier in style and without any awkward pulling and tugging to get the cork off. the elegantly designed wine tool is also a great gift that anyone would love to receive along with a bottle of wine. while it’s less cumbersome than a lever corkscrew or winged corkscrew and can more easily be stowed away in any kitchen drawer","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zMIHTGQkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KITVINOUS","source_asin":"B0B5GQBKRW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1092187","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5GQBKRW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5GQBKRW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
