window.products.push({"id":1092203,"name":"TOSFOGO Customized Best Friends Blanket with Personalized 4 Photos Collage & Texts, Custom Throw Blankets for Friends Birthday Gifts, 32'' X 48''","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613LXM5w+hS._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"TOSFOGO Custom blanket with photos texts personalized throw blankets - Design Your Own Flannel Fleece Blankets Now!Features:1.Design your own special fluffy plush ultra-soft micro flannel throw blankets with the photos or pictures or text you love.2. Made of high quality anti-pilling flannel, which is soft touch, pilling resistance, wrinkle resistance, durable and comfortable, have a good touch and friendly to your skin, your child, your pet.3. Suitable for all seasons, perfect for bed, sofa, camping, cold movie theater or traveling.4. Easy to Care: Machine washable or hand washable, tumble dry at low temperature, holds several machine wash and dry beautifully.5. No matter what photo you provide, such as your family, friends, pets, scenery, we will print them well on your personalized blanket, which will be the most unique gifts or souvenirs on various holiday, anniversaries.6.Perfect gifts for Birthday, Christmas, Thanksgiving, Valentine's Day, Mother's Day, Father's Day, Wedding PartyHow to Customize:1.Choose the size and style you want2. Click \"Customize Now\" button3.Upload your photos and input your text, adjust their size/position to achieve your expected effect4.Add to cardAttention Please:1. The images you upload should be above 1 MB.2.The other side of the blanket is white color.3. We will print image what you uploaded instead of what we showed.4. If necessary, we will further process your pictures to achieve the best visual effect.Customer Service:After handling, it will take about 12-20 workdays for the standard shipping, and 5-9 days for the expedited shippingPlease feel free to contact us if you have any questions or other request of customized products. We will reply you in 24 hours. Thank you for your trust.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613LXM5w+hS._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TOSFOGO","source_asin":"B0937HMJHZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1092203","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0937HMJHZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0937HMJHZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1092204,"name":"MUSICAL INSTRUMENTS","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.44,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51c5Jgpvs4L._AC_.jpg","description":"Become your own chocolatier with CybrTrayd’s complete line of confectionary making supplies! We offer a variety of food-grade PETG plastic molds that are durable and can be reused for a multitude of projects. Create chocolates for all occasions using our traditional shapes for cookie and cake molds or invest in more elaborate 3-D designs. Each mold is sealed in a poly bag with CybrTrayd instructions imprinted on it. This will provide details on chocolate melting and molding for all our molds, including the hollow 3-D molds. In addition, we’ve provided some tips and tricks for getting the best possible results. All of our plastic designs can also be used for soap making. Additional directions are provided soap melt & pour techniques.To prevent any damage to your mold please wash by hand and do not put it in the dishwasher. These plastic molds are not meant to be used with hard candy. The molds are not suitable for children under 3 and should only be used by older children with adult supervision.Chocolates make great favors or treats for parties and other special occasions. Use the hearts, strawberries, rose and other flowers for romantic gestures such as wedding favors or a Valentine’s Day surprise. Trees, ornaments, candy canes and other festive references are perfect for the holiday season. All of our adorable baby molds are ideal for showers and gender reveal parties. You can also add pop sticks to some of the chocolates and create lollipop celebrations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51c5Jgpvs4L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CybrTrayd","source_asin":"B000EJRAEG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1092204","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000EJRAEG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000EJRAEG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
