window.products.push({"id":1092285,"name":"Gentle Lion 3 Elephants with Trunk up, Resin Family Elephant Statues on Bridge Trunk Statue Mom Baby Lucky Wealthy Elephant Figurine Feng Shui Decorat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51k8k8o0DcL._AC_.jpg","description":"Multiple Decor Options - elephants decorations for home at the front door are said to bring good luck, protection, and strength to the household. Use it as a centerpiece ornament, a center table piece, side table embellishment or as a garden adornment in your home, office or studio to improve the aesthetic appeal, and create a relaxing & welcoming ambience. High Quality Material - This new Set of 3 Golden Color Thai lucky family elephant sculpture with trunk facing upwards is made of high quality electroplated polyresin durable design. Size：11 x 5.9 x 2.4 in. Hand Painted - Three Elephant Figurine is painted to resemble ivory elephant finish. Because our polyresin products are individually hand-crafted works of art, colors may vary slightly from what is pictured here. Feng Shui Decor - Elephants are considered a symbol of good luck for many reasons, most of them tracing their origin to ancient folklore, as well as Asian religions and mythologies. For this specific feng shui application, always have the elephant figurines with trunk up, which allows the lucky energy to be dispersed throughout your home or office. Perfect Figurine Sculpture - Three Mama and Baby Elephant statue in a trunk are perfect gifts for housewarming, office decoration, living room and bedroom. This trunk facing up elegant elephant is a perfect gift for birthdays, weddings, Easter, Valentine’s Day, Thanksgiving, Christmas and new year Holidays or any other occasion.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51k8k8o0DcL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gentle Lion","source_asin":"B09K7KHKKB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1092285","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09K7KHKKB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09K7KHKKB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1092286,"name":"Oversized Clothes Pins 6\", Pack of 2 Giant Clothespins for Wall, Crafting and DIY Room Décor, by Woodpeckers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yI0alnvPS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"CRAFT BIG-Giant clothespins are everything their smaller version is, only bigger, better, and stronger. So, no hanging clothes on a line, but how ‘bout attaching these jumbo clothespins to the laundry room wall and hanging clothes? Or the kitchen wall and hanging towels? With a tight grip and easy open, these large clothes pins can display it all and are the perfect towel clothespin. MAKE IT YOUR WAY-If you're a crafter, check these out for your next DIY home décor project. Decorate these easy to paint, stain, or decoupage pre-sanded pins to suit your style, and then hang them on the wall to display artwork for a clothespins wall décor look that's uniquely yours. Attach magnets to the back of these clothes pins and hang shopping lists, bills, and photos on your fridge. BREEZY COOKING AND HOSTING-Meet the newest place card holder or card display! Flip these large wooden clothes pins over for a display stand that's steady and won't topple over. Have easy access to a recipe card while in the kitchen or proudly display photos with an over-sized clothes pin that will hold even the thinnest paper. WASH, DRY, FOLD, DECORATE-When we say large, we do mean large! These giant clothes pins are 6\" long and open up to create a gap of 3/4\", making them the true heavy duty clothespin. But their giant size just makes them more adorable! If you're decorating your laundry room, this is a do not miss accent piece for rustic or farmhouse laundry room décor. WOOD PARTS BY CRAFTERS, FOR CRAFTERS - At Woodpeckers, crafting and building with wood is our thing. Bringing you more of the wood craft supplies you love is our fun. And seeing pics of your creative creations - that's our after-we-finish-today's-work treat! Have questions about your product? Please do get in touch.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yI0alnvPS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Woodpeckers","source_asin":"B08GV9TKWN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1092286","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GV9TKWN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GV9TKWN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
