window.products.push({"id":1092338,"name":"Bed Maker's Fresh Ideas Electric Handheld 120V AC Air Pump, Multiuse Indoor Household Use, Cream, HDB760XXASSTXX","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oluXkbORL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you have ever blown up an air mattress or large pool innertube without a pump, then you know how difficult it can be. Our Electric Handheld 120V AC Air Pump makes all your inflating and deflating needs a breeze. It’s simple—just plug in our pump, attach the appropriate nozzle, affix to whatever needs to be filled or deflated, and flip the switch–that’s it! Keep it at the house to inflate air beds for sleepovers or out of town guests, take it on vacation to blow up tubes and floats at the beach, lake, or pool, or use for tubing in the snow. It’s always a great idea to have handy on a camping trip or to just keep one in your mobile home. The best part is that it’s small and doesn’t need a detachable hose, pins, needles, or a ton of other accessories. It just has three small interchangeable nozzles to ensure a seamless fit with whatever you are inflating or deflating. As hard as it is to manually inflate something, deflating it and getting all the air out seems impossible–but our electric pump does the work for you! When it's time to pack away your inflatables, all you need to do is reattach the pump, flip a switch, and sit back and relax. No more fighting to get the last bit of air out so you can neatly pack away your inflatables until it’s time to use them again. The Levinsohn Electric Handheld Air Pump is efficient, saves you time, and allows for more fun and the relaxation you deserve.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oluXkbORL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bed Maker's","source_asin":"B09X8RSLF8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1092338","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09X8RSLF8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09X8RSLF8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
