window.products.push({"id":1092400,"name":"Parkco Rustic Fireplace Floating Mantel Shelf - Rustic Reclaimed Barn Wood Wall Decor. Mounting Hardware Included (30\" W x 5\" D x 2.75\" H)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":92.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31OmBsOHmNL._AC_.jpg","description":"These are AUTHENTIC Reclaimed Wood Beams salvaged from old barns, houses and other structures dating back to the late 1800's. No two pieces are the same making these perfect for barnwood fireplace mantels or barnwood floating shelves. These are NOT a fresh-cut piece of wood that has been distressed and sold off as \"Rustic\". Our authentic, reclaimed lumber is salvaged in most of the Eastern United States. That means that our shelves are sourced and handcrafted right here in America! The easy-to-use mounting hardware is provided and our pieces are ROUTED in the back so the hardware is actually hidden. These shelves will hold 25 lbs with ease. If you're looking for a real piece of American History repurposed by a small family-owned business, then our 3x5 reclaimed wall shelves are your answer! Dimensions: 3 inches high x 5 inches wide x x the length you select. Length options range from 18 to 96 inches Characteristics to be expected: Hand Hewing (axe marks) Hand Hewing (axe marks) Saw Markings Saw Markings Waning (slight rounded edge) Waning (slight rounded edge) Knots Knots Raised Grain Patterns Raised Grain Patterns Nail Holes Nail Holes Peg Holes Peg Holes Mortise Pockets Mortise Pockets Wormholes Wormholes Finish will vary based on: Wood Species Wood Species Prior Use of the piece Prior Use of the piece Prior exposure to elements Prior exposure to elements While always being a medium brown, tone can vary within the piece and per piece. Red, golden or orange undertones are possible While always being a medium brown, tone can vary within the piece and per piece. Red, golden or orange undertones are possible Weight: These are COMPLETELY solid pieces! Structural support required for mounting. These are COMPLETELY solid pieces! Structural support required for mounting. Reach out to us to find the approximate weight if unsure Reach out to us to find the approximate weight if unsure Hardware: The hardware provided will allow for the weight of the shelf plus about 25 lbs of shelf weight allowance as long as installed properly but please reach out to confirm for specific sizes","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31OmBsOHmNL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Parkco","source_asin":"B07JZFL8FB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1092400","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JZFL8FB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JZFL8FB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
