window.products.push({"id":1092431,"name":"DolliBu Pug Dog Plush Refrigerator Magnet – Fluffy Dog Stuffed Plush Magnet, Cute Pet Animal Magnet for Kitchen Fridge and Locker, Home Decor and Offi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-I3CY6pqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE PUG DOG PLUSH TOY MAGNET DECOR COMES WITH UNIQUE DESIGN YOU WILL LOVE – Bring out the kid in you and display your cute collection of animal novelty magnets! Soft & fluffy home decor to add cuteness to any surface that attracts magnets. DolliBu’s Pug Dog Plush Fridge Magnet will surely attract anyone who sees the adorable stuffed magnet decor. A must-have home & office accessory to use as convenient note holders & home or office decor. THE COOL FRIDGE MAGNETS ARE FOR WHIMSICAL NOVELTIES LOVERS – Perfect home & office ornament for magnet collectors and animal lovers who’d like to add funky decor magnets to their stationery to help them stay organized. Surprise your colleagues with entertaining unique & decorative plush magnets to hang pictures, memories, pictures, or random notes. Ideal for parents who love leaving cute notes for their little ones or to post grocery lists. INCLUDED WITH THE PURCHASE OF CUTE REFRIGERATOR MAGNET – Includes 1 DolliBu Pug Dog Plush Fridge Magnet. The collectible magnet features a cuddly pug dog pet animal decorated with soft plush rounded paws and little legs. The unique magnetic decor is designed with realistic animal details & colored with high-quality brown making it the perfect accent for plain-colored refrigerators. Cute kitchen fridge magnet measures 4.25 Lx3 Wx1.6 H inches. HIGH-QUALITY STUFFED PET PLUSH ANIMAL MAGNET – Fun magnets for refrigerator and locker are made of 100% polyester materials with high-quality soft fillings & a strong magnet attached to the back of the 3D-shaped plush pet dog animal figure. The magnetic pug plush figure looks so adorable with its little eyes. Use the beautifully designed plush pug magnetic home decor to add an irresistibly charming accessory to your stationery. IDEAL USE FOR THE PET ANIMAL REFRIGERATOR MAGNET – Decorate your kitchen fridge door, dishwasher, locker, whiteboards, cabinet, and any metal surfaces that attract magnets with fun novelty magnets. Pug dog magnets make a cool display on the kitchen fridge & an amusing locker decor to help in posting notes, recipes, checklists, reminders, photos, & drawings. A perfectly functional & multi-use magnet for the home or any office work-space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-I3CY6pqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DolliBu","source_asin":"B09DNQ8TTG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1092431","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DNQ8TTG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DNQ8TTG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
