window.products.push({"id":1092577,"name":"Overket 100% Bamboo Sheets-Cooling Sheets Queen Luxury Super Soft Breathable Silky Bamboo Bed Sheets-16 Deep Pocket 4 Pieces Set-Cream White Queen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fbBsubZ+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% PURE ORGANIC BAMBOO : Overket bamboo cooling sheets Crafted from the finest 100% Organic Bamboo.The ultimate coolness and softness of silk .allowing them to be temperature regulated, breathable and moisture absorbent - ideal for all seasons comfort. No sheets are softer than these.Say goodbye on hot night. Good news for Hot Sleeper. BAMBOO SHEETS QUEEN : This luxury bamboo sheets include 2 pillowcases 20*30 inch, 1 flat sheet 90*102 inch, 1 fitted sheet 60*80inch, can wrap 16 inch deep pockets will fit nicely your bed and do not come off the corners.Snug size, no need to worry about it moving in the middle of the night.Create a comfortable sleeping environment. COOLING&BREATHABLE : Best bamboo sheets Have a good comfort experience.Cooling, silky, breathable, soft and skin-friendly. Cooling bamboo sheets make sleep easy, cool, and comfortable.Perfect for those who sleep hot and sweaty. EASY TO WASH CARE : Unlike classic silk sheets, bamboo sheets are durable and machine washable. Wash your bamboo sheets in cold water on a gentle cycle. Dry at low temperature. To avoid wrinkling, take the sheets out of the dryer as soon as possible.In addition, please avoid using fabric softeners and bleaches.Do not mix with other clothes. CUSTOMER SERVICE : We focus on quality and provide you with the best sheets possible ! If you’re not thrilled with your sheets for any reason, at any point, simply let us know.No Matter a Day, a Month, a Year, or Even Longer. Online Quick Reply Within 24 Hours.Unconditional full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fbBsubZ+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Overket","source_asin":"B0C2PWT7YS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1092577","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2PWT7YS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2PWT7YS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
