window.products.push({"id":1092742,"name":"Two-piece Uzbek bread stamp chekich set for sale 7 cm / 3.5 cm diameter + BONUS","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41MT5Sdx+CL.jpg","description":"A set of two wooden bread embossing tools widely used by Central Asian bakers in making delicious and beautiful-looking flat round bread called Non or Lepeshka.  Each Uzbek bread stamp chekich for sale is made of walnut wood with iron pins arranged into floral patterns. It is used to emboss various designs at the centre of circular flat bread.  - Handmade item  - Craft type: baking, candy making, kids' crafts  - Dimensions: 7 cm (2.75 inches) and 3.5 cm (1.37 inches) in diameter and both are about 13.5 cm (5.31 inches) long  - Material: walnut wood, iron pins  - Condition: brand new  PLEASE NOTE: Since walnut wood is seldom homogenous in texture, the wooden part of your purchase might not look exactly the same as the one(s) pictured, with only slight variations. The pattern design, however, is always as pictured.  - We guarantee you'll love our bread stamp(s) or your money back  - Makes an ideal Central Asia-theme gift  - Added durability (made from walnut tree)  - Safer from injury (blunted pins)  - No chemical or artificial substances used  - Comes with a short maintenance guide  - As a bonus, you get e-books on popular Uzbek bread and other food recipes  - By buying this pair of bread stamps, you contribute to a better quality of life for rural Uzbek craftspeople","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41MT5Sdx+CL.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B07HGFBP8L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1092742","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HGFBP8L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HGFBP8L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1092743,"name":"Electric Gravity Salt and Pepper Grinder, Automatic Pepper and Salt Mill, Battery-Operated with Adjustable Coarseness, Premium Stainless Steel with LE","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ulfPt02PL._AC_SL1303_.jpg","description":"🤩【High Quality Materials】This electric salt and pepper grinder set has a big and wide mouth spice container,brushed stainless steel body of anti-corrosion,adjustables ceramic blades and refillable--Just simply screws stainless steel top off the wide opening, and refill it easily with no mess.The modern and fashionable design is the perfect addition to any kitchen and also a great gift. 👩‍🍳【Automatic Operation】Our gravity salt and pepper grinder set allow you will not need both of your hands to grind your spices. Better than other brands;you won’t even need to press a button! Simply flipped the grinder and you will have fresh ground spices! Convenient and funny. 🍛【Adjustable Coarseness】Electric pepper grinder with adjustable grinder,just turn the black knob on top of salt or pepper mill,you can easily adjust the grinder knob to choose the coarseness of your spice,salt or peppercorn.Many grinding levels for your choice allows you to grinder your spices from coarse to fine. 🔵【Blue Led Light】Why our salt and pepper grinder set choose blue LED light? --Blue light is not only bright but gentle.You can't imagine how warm and romantic it will be when you have dinner with family or lover;The blue light will turn ON with a simple wrist twist,you will easily be able to see amount of salt and pepper you put in your food. 💟【100% Satisfaction & Money Back Guarantee】Our electric salt and pepper grinder offers a whole year warranty and lifetime support,you can request a full refund within 30 days of your order. totally no risk for you! Please rest assured to buy and use.If you have any other questions, please contact us ,we offer 7*24 friendly customer service","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ulfPt02PL._AC_SL1303_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BANIC","source_asin":"B08S46GDZ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1092743","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08S46GDZ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08S46GDZ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
