window.products.push({"id":1092995,"name":"AME D'ESSENCE (50 PC-SET) 24 oz Meal Prep Lunch Containers with Lids Disposable Food Storage Containers Bento Boxes 1 Comp BPA Free Freezer Dishwasher","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51M4kprRcIL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"50 PC/SET: BASE 25 PC - LIDS 25 PC COMPLETE COMPLETE CONVENIENCE MEAL PLAN - Your effort to premake your meals for the week and reheat them to enjoy are made so much easier with HOMEE meal prep containers, our bento boxes are custom-made for the active in mind to eat healthily and fill the right portions of food in no time. MICROWAVEABLE, DISHWASHER, FREEZER SAFE & LEAK-RESISTANT DESIGN - Made of the highest quality food-safe materials, these bento boxes and lids withstand temperatures from -40 to 250, making them completely microwave or freezer safe! And the best part? For easy as a breeze cleaning you can even pop them in the dishwasher. Note also that thanks to their stackable, space-saving design, these prep containers fit into one another for easy and convenient storage! SAFE MATERIAL - BPA-Free and Food-Grade Safe PP material. You can reuse these durable containers as many times as you like. Clean these portion control boxes easily by placing them on the top rack of the dishwasher. If you don’t want to reuse them you can simply throw these containers into a recycling bin or trash. ENJOY A HEALTHY MEAL EVERYWHERE - With these prep meal containers reusable, super practical lunch boxes you can always enjoy healthy, homemade meals everywhere. Pack a fresh salad, fruits, carrots, or any dry snacks in this ultimate bento box / disposable food container for adults or kids; perfect for work or school, just put it in your lunch bag, backpack, gym bag or handbag 25 PACK VERSATILE FOOD STORAGE CONTAINERS - These stackable carry out containers with lids are perfect for packaging food at your deli, kiosk, food truck, catering service or restaurant for to-go meals. 24 oz they stack neatly on top of each other allowing for completely mess-free transportation and making all your customers happy as well","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51M4kprRcIL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AME D'ESSENCE","source_asin":"B0899PRJX8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1092995","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0899PRJX8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0899PRJX8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
